PENDING PRODUCTION PATCH - exopipe_ops/p3s2_conform.py: a switch for the conformance's axis-ratio step (P3_CONFORM_AXIS)
=========================================================================================================================
Not applied. exopipe_ops belongs to its owning chat: apply it there, by its commit. The refactor's default is now
catalog_conform.CONFORM_AXIS_UNDER_RULE = 'replace' (R-REFACTOR-20261104-AXIS-RULE-ALONE-FULLBAND-SIZE-OFF-FROM-PULSARS, below), so
under the ruled default every refactor stage that runs this script on attempts searched under the size / axis rule REFUSES until
